--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec4ba6a512adabf4b8a74985cb2f4d14, type: 3}
  m_Name: VladDay1ClosingDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScriptedDialogue
  nodes:
  - type: 0
    npcLine: Good work. If you need any more info, the guidebook is over there on
      the table.
    animationTrigger: TalkPoint
    cameraTrigger: GuideBook
    wobbleText: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: The job is straightforward. They have the symptoms, you make the call...
    animationTrigger: TalkDismissing
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: Pass. Quarantine. Kill.
    animationTrigger: TalkPoint
    cameraTrigger: InkStamp
    wobbleText: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: Quarantine allows us to cure their symptoms before they get too severe,
      effectively reversing their mutations.
    animationTrigger: TalkLookAway
    cameraTrigger: Quarantine
    wobbleText: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: Killing should only be a last resort. When someone is gone, they're
      gone for good.
    animationTrigger: TalkLookAway
    cameraTrigger: RedInk
    wobbleText: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: As much as I dislike the people in this town, we need each other in
      times like these. For better or for worse.
    animationTrigger: TalkShrug
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: Don't fuck it up.
    animationTrigger: TalkBigCocky
    cameraTrigger: VladFace
    wobbleText: 1
    choices: []
